    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d241">

                <pb facs="0388" n="300" xml:id="pg300"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Herbert to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                            York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1892-08-20"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">August 20, 1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Much regret to say have missed connection, owing to hot box, and can not be in
                    Washington till 2; if not inconvenient to you might I follow you to-morrow or
                    next day?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
